            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "Anxiety and work-related stress"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "SectionName": "HISTORY_OF_PRESENT_ILLNESS",
        "Summary": [
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "846688bb-791a-4179-920f-2c85e8a71c4a"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "6fadbc3c-03aa-4917-aa3d-e0dbc49fb2d1"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "347942bb-189c-49bd-ba64-434ae61397da"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "The patient presents for follow-up regarding anxiety and work-related stress."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "846688bb-791a-4179-920f-2c85e8a71c4a"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "6fadbc3c-03aa-4917-aa3d-e0dbc49fb2d1"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "347942bb-189c-49bd-ba64-434ae61397da"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "They report an uneven week, initially feeling organized but becoming overwhelmed when work became busy.\n"
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "611f3848-2a6d-4b53-967a-c8f6edad1c10"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "398c814a-a204-4838-bd1b-f48f4b90cf69"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "The patient describes a specific incident on Tuesday afternoon during a meeting when their manager asked for an update on a draft that was not yet finished."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "1daf909d-b01f-4d30-9b93-10198179640c"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "b1e3fdf9-5b09-4d23-bac0-4aee0cce7fb7"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "This triggered feelings of inadequacy, with the patient thinking \"everyone can tell I'm not keeping up.\""
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "752e02b7-e6f5-4b43-ac50-19d28f02a25d"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "They experienced facial flushing and difficulty focusing during the meeting."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "631fdc12-d846-482a-ad6f-ce71ea41ffd1"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "Afterward, the patient attempted to work faster but found themselves rereading the same email repeatedly."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "b3db31e0-0da2-4bfa-926b-979c5e647b11"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "They skipped their usual walk and worked through dinner, which did not make them feel more caught up and instead left them tired and more critical of themselves.\n"
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "e0c63df6-f860-410b-8c31-a32ec0cdcea0"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "The patient describes a pattern where anxiety about work leads to decreased productivity, which in turn increases anxiety."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "285d1c9b-32b6-4d51-9ea7-c808ae99ac90"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "e0c63df6-f860-410b-8c31-a32ec0cdcea0"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "They acknowledge that the pressure to catch up makes it harder to concentrate.\n"
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "dd711f93-9d13-44c0-88e0-1c0adaa59404"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "efbed106-c914-4ac6-9227-6c776b4e8ff9"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "a8ba0c4b-ebde-4e10-b898-bbbec38c8a50"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "When asked to examine the evidence for their belief that others noticed they were not keeping up, the patient realized they had little evidence \u2014 their manager had asked a normal question and a coworker had commented that the timeline looked reasonable."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "09083ce2-38ec-400a-b125-a20ba3286b58"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "They had completed most of the research and had already informed their manager the draft would be ready Wednesday."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "6b9575b8-268d-49fd-a4a7-4fb6cf262732"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "The patient recognized they had treated one question as proof of failure.\n"
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "f5149501-18c6-4745-bc8e-662d2da476a9"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "7b87191d-35f1-4bf7-b235-5bebb0bdcdcf"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "Later that evening, the patient was self-critical, calling themselves \"lazy\" despite having worked all day."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "3d276ac4-408b-4ced-b161-7f79a3757626"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "219c90d0-80e6-4587-86f3-0acdfa362695"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "When asked to apply the same compassion they would show a friend, the patient acknowledged this approach felt \"a little strange but calmer\" and more fair.\n"
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "3aa7031d-f036-4de2-95d7-9cfa7ca299c3"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "ae66cb63-59dc-46d4-97e5-64ccda12af33"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "The patient reports a restorative experience on Saturday morning, spending 20 minutes outside with coffee and their dog without a goal or phone."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "ae66cb63-59dc-46d4-97e5-64ccda12af33"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "They felt \"like myself again\" during this time.\n"
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "97ec65d3-2cb4-4019-85e4-43c2ee778e75"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "Regarding sleep, the patient reports it was \"ok most nights\" with approximately 7 hours of sleep."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "f960c9a2-70f6-415f-bdc4-95922960bb4a"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "They ate regularly except on Tuesday, when they were too wound up to notice hunger."
          },
          {
            "EvidenceLinks": [
              {
                "SegmentId": "46aabfa3-2efe-49be-8286-536668ec1a16"
              },
              {
                "SegmentId": "e5fbf3fc-fc91-4741-b2f1-ab0f5d533964"
              }
            ],
            "SummarizedSegment": "The patient identified early warning signs of stress including tight shoulders and holding their breath.\n"
          }
        ]
      },
